{"id":"eee1caaab6856e0d","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-analytic.md","title":"Analytic Set","display":"df-analytic — Analytic Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-analytic","aliases":["58-df-analytic"],"display":"df-analytic — Analytic Set","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-analytic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-analytic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-analytic — Analytic Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span> (analytic-set candidate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall d\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(\\tau_d\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R^d))\">\\(\\forall d\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(\\tau_d\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R^d))\\)</span> (standard Euclidean topologies)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{B}(\\mathbb{R}^d,\\tau_d)\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R^d)\">\\(\\mathcal{B}(\\mathbb{R}^d,\\tau_d)\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R^d)\\)</span> (Borel sigma-algebra, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Analytic}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Analytic}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (dimension-independent unary analytic-set predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_d=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(\\mathbb R^d,d)\">\\(\\tau_d=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(\\mathbb R^d,d)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x^\\frown y=x\\cup\\{\\langle n+j,y(j)\\rangle:j\\in m\\}\">\\(x^\\frown y=x\\cup\\{\\langle n+j,y(j)\\rangle:j\\in m\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathbb R^n\">\\(x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\mathbb R^m\">\\(y\\in\\mathbb R^m\\)</span>；拼接仍为长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+m\">\\(n+m\\)</span> 的有限函数，不是有序对。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analytic} \\vdash \\mathrm{Analytic}(A) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\exists n,m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^{n+m},\\tau_{n+m})\\;\\left(A\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land A=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\mid\\exists y\\in\\mathbb R^m\\;(x^\\frown y\\in B)\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analytic} \\vdash \\mathrm{Analytic}(A) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\exists n,m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^{n+m},\\tau_{n+m})\\;\\left(A\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land A=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\mid\\exists y\\in\\mathbb R^m\\;(x^\\frown y\\in B)\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Quantifying the ambient dimension makes the unary predicate independent of an unrecorded external parameter; this preserves the existing downstream signature <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Analytic}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Analytic}(A)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Analytic sets are continuous images of Borel sets</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^1_1\">\\(\\Sigma^1_1\\)</span> 是解析集的第一射影类</li>\n<li>投影函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_{\\mathbb{R}^n}(B) = \\{x \\in \\mathbb{R}^n : \\exists y \\in \\mathbb{R}^m\\;((x, y) \\in B)\\}\">\\(\\pi_{\\mathbb{R}^n}(B) = \\{x \\in \\mathbb{R}^n : \\exists y \\in \\mathbb{R}^m\\;((x, y) \\in B)\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca7fc3ab38a11801","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{B}(\\mathbb{R}^d,\\tau_d)\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R^d)$ (Borel sigma-algebra, see [[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall d\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(\\tau_d\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R^d))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{B}(\\mathbb{R}^d,\\tau_d)\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R^d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Analytic}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_d=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(\\mathbb R^d,d)","display":false},{"tex":"x^\\frown y=x\\cup\\{\\langle n+j,y(j)\\rangle:j\\in m\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in\\mathbb R^m","display":false},{"tex":"n+m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analytic} \\vdash \\mathrm{Analytic}(A) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\exists n,m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^{n+m},\\tau_{n+m})\\;\\left(A\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land A=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\mid\\exists y\\in\\mathbb R^m\\;(x^\\frown y\\in B)\\}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Analytic}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^1_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_{\\mathbb{R}^n}(B) = \\{x \\in \\mathbb{R}^n : \\exists y \\in \\mathbb{R}^m\\;((x, y) \\in B)\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1607,"backlinks":[{"id":"0a89278846ca9cc1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Analytic}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-analytic]])"},{"id":"4bd6738f7a0d310b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"560573e5a86ebf34","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb R$ (analytic sets, see [[../batch08/58-df-analytic.md]])"},{"id":"ff3393113d3c8fe1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Analytic}$ (analytic-set predicate, see [[../batch08/58-df-analytic.md]])"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-189","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-analytic]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-132","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-analytic.md|58-df-analytic]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["ca7fc3ab38a11801","9375de7089953a2b"]}